cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and cite the dataset you screened."
title: "disruptionpy-qfc: attribution-stability screening for DisruptionPy-format shot data"
abstract: "Independent software, not affiliated with MIT PSFC or the DisruptionPy maintainers. It measures whether a model trained on one set of discharges relies on the same features on another (QFC, Quantitative Feature Consistency) and scores the change against the model's own no-shift floor, without labels on the new data."
